  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.36 - (January 15, 2026)\n- FIXED: Recursive Fragment parameter resolution (now supports nested paths and NCalc in fragments).\n- IMPROVED: Support for literal keys containing dots (e.g., \"Nav.Main\" can now be a direct dictionary key).\n- NEW: Definition Hoisting - <Define> tags can now be placed anywhere in the template (order independence).\n- NEW: Global Variables Support with thread-safe ConcurrentDictionary.",
